<path d="M 63 47 L 60 47 L 59 49 L 57 48 L 57 51 L 54 57 L 62 50 Z M 45 46 L 44 47 L 45 51 L 49 55 L 52 56 L 50 55 L 51 54 L 49 51 L 49 48 L 48 48 L 47 46 Z M 88 39 L 87 38 L 79 38 L 78 37 L 80 33 L 81 25 L 74 25 L 68 28 L 65 23 L 53 12 L 42 23 L 40 28 L 33 25 L 26 25 L 27 27 L 27 33 L 28 36 L 30 37 L 29 38 L 20 38 L 17 40 L 20 44 L 26 49 L 29 49 L 34 51 L 35 50 L 36 51 L 29 48 L 24 42 L 25 40 L 28 40 L 30 41 L 35 47 L 38 48 L 39 50 L 43 52 L 43 51 L 35 44 L 31 33 L 32 32 L 31 30 L 32 29 L 37 30 L 42 34 L 45 26 L 51 21 L 53 18 L 62 26 L 64 29 L 64 33 L 65 34 L 70 30 L 73 30 L 74 29 L 76 30 L 75 31 L 74 38 L 70 44 L 71 46 L 68 47 L 68 48 L 63 52 L 69 49 L 74 43 L 78 40 L 81 40 L 82 42 L 79 46 L 72 50 L 72 51 L 78 50 L 79 48 L 80 49 L 87 43 Z" fill="#F4B400" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
<path d="M 131 51 L 132 52 L 132 59 L 129 61 L 127 61 L 125 59 L 125 55 L 128 52 Z M 154 43 L 158 44 L 160 48 L 160 57 L 157 62 L 154 62 L 152 60 L 152 45 Z M 92 37 L 92 43 L 96 48 L 107 53 L 109 55 L 109 60 L 105 63 L 102 63 L 96 58 L 94 53 L 92 53 L 91 54 L 91 61 L 96 64 L 106 65 L 112 63 L 116 59 L 117 59 L 121 64 L 128 64 L 132 61 L 135 64 L 140 64 L 143 62 L 144 64 L 146 64 L 149 62 L 152 64 L 160 64 L 165 61 L 168 55 L 167 45 L 163 41 L 160 40 L 154 42 L 152 41 L 152 31 L 148 31 L 142 33 L 142 34 L 144 35 L 144 60 L 143 61 L 140 60 L 140 46 L 139 44 L 134 40 L 125 40 L 122 41 L 118 45 L 118 47 L 120 49 L 123 49 L 125 47 L 125 45 L 127 42 L 130 42 L 132 44 L 132 48 L 130 50 L 127 50 L 120 53 L 118 56 L 116 50 L 112 46 L 103 42 L 100 39 L 100 35 L 102 33 L 107 33 L 112 37 L 113 40 L 115 40 L 116 39 L 116 33 L 112 31 L 101 31 L 96 33 Z" fill="#4E342E" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
</svg>

      </a>

      <nav class="sp-header-nav" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s141' | t }}">
        <a class="sp-header-nav-link{% if template.name == 'index' %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'home' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s124' | t }}</span></a>
        <a class="sp-header-nav-link{% if request.path == '/collections/all' %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'shop' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s236' | t }}</span></a>

        <div class="sp-collections-menu">
          <a class="sp-header-nav-link sp-collections-trigger{% if template.name == 'collection' and request.path != '/collections/all' %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">
            {% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'grid' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s051' | t }}</span>{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'chevron-down', class: 'sp-icon sp-icon-sm' %}
          </a>
          <div class="sp-collections-dropdown" role="menu" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s051' | t }}">
            <div class="sp-collections-dropdown-inner">
              <a role="menuitem" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?sort_by=best-selling">
                <span class="sp-menu-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l2.7 5.5 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1-4.4-4.3 6.1-.9L12 3z"/></svg></span>
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s098' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s169' | t }}</small></span>
              </a>
              <a role="menuitem" href="{{ collections['puja-kit'].url }}">
                <span class="sp-menu-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12v10H4V12"/><path d="M2 7h20v5H2z"/><path d="M12 22V7"/><path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7Z"/><path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7Z"/></svg></span>
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s199' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s184' | t }}</small></span>
              </a>
              <a role="menuitem" class="sp-menu-subitem" href="{{ all_products['daily-puja-kit'].url }}">
                <span class="sp-menu-icon">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'calendar' %}</span>
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s068' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s088' | t }}</small></span>
              </a>
              <a role="menuitem" class="sp-menu-subitem" href="{{ all_products['navratri-puja-kit'].url }}">
                <span class="sp-menu-icon">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'sparkles' %}</span>
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s146' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s100' | t }}</small></span>
              </a>
              <a role="menuitem" class="sp-menu-subitem" href="{{ all_products['diwali-puja-kit'].url }}">
                <span class="sp-menu-icon">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'gift' %}</span>
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s080' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s081' | t }}</small></span>
              </a>
              <a role="menuitem" href="{{ collections['astrology-remedy-kits'].url }}">
                <span class="sp-menu-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/><path d="m5.6 5.6 12.8 12.8m0-12.8L5.6 18.4"/></svg></span>
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s020' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s007' | t }}</small></span>
              </a>
              <a role="menuitem" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?sort_by=created-descending">
                <span class="sp-menu-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="m5.6 5.6 12.8 12.8"/><path d="m18.4 5.6-12.8 12.8"/></svg></span>
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s151' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s209' | t }}</small></span>
              </a>
              <a role="menuitem" href="{{ collections['puja-items'].url }}">
                <span class="sp-menu-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20"/><path d="M2 12h20"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg></span>
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s197' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s087' | t }}</small></span>
              </a>
              <a role="menuitem" class="sp-menu-all" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
                <span><strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s238' | t }}</strong><small>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s029' | t }}</small></span>
                <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-icon"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <form class="sp-header-search" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search">
        <input type="hidden" name="type" value="product">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-icon"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input type="search" name="q" value="{{ search.terms | escape }}" placeholder="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s229' | t }}" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s228' | t }}">
      </form>

      <div class="sp-header-controls">
        <div class="sp-language-switcher sp-language-native" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_polish.language_selector' | t }}">
          {% form 'localization', id: 'sp-language-en' %}
            <input type="hidden" name="locale_code" value="en">
            <button
              class="sp-language-option{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %} is-active{% endif %}"
              type="submit"
              data-sp-language-choice="en"
              aria-pressed="{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
              lang="en"
              title="English"
            >EN</button>
          {% endform %}
          {% form 'localization', id: 'sp-language-hi' %}
            <input type="hidden" name="locale_code" value="hi">
            <button
              class="sp-language-option{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'hi' %} is-active{% endif %}"
              type="submit"
              data-sp-language-choice="hi"
              aria-pressed="{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'hi' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
              lang="hi"
              title="हिंदी"
            >हिं</button>
          {% endform %}
        </div>

        <details class="sp-header-utility sp-header-notifications">
          <summary class="sp-icon-button" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s161' | t }}" title="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s161' | t }}">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-icon"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 7-3 9h18c0-2-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M10 21h4"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="sp-header-utility-panel" role="status">
            <strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s156' | t }}</strong>
            <p>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s165' | t }}</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <a class="sp-icon-button sp-account-icon-button" href="/account" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s014' | t }}" title="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s014' | t }}">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-icon"><path d="M20 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
        </a>

        <details class="sp-header-utility sp-header-wishlist">
          <summary class="sp-icon-button" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s288' | t }}" title="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s288' | t }}">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-icon"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1.1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="sp-header-utility-panel">
            <strong>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s296' | t }}</strong>
            <p>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s226' | t }}</p>
            <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ 'sabpuja_polish.browse_products' | t }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </details>

        <a class="sp-icon-button sp-cart-icon-button" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_polish.cart_with_items' | t: count: cart.item_count }}" title="{{ 'sabpuja_polish.cart' | t }}">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-icon"><path d="M6 8h12l1 13H5L6 8Z"/><path d="M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/></svg>
          {% if cart.item_count > 0 %}<span class="sp-cart-count">{{ cart.item_count }}</span>{% endif %}
        </a>

        <details class="sp-mobile-menu">
          <summary class="sp-icon-button" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s162' | t }}">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-icon"><path d="M4 6h16"/><path d="M4 12h16"/><path d="M4 18h16"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="sp-mobile-menu-panel">
            <button type="button" class="sp-mobile-menu-action" data-sp-language-open>
              <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-ui-icon"><path d="M4 5h10M9 3v2M6 8c1.4 3.1 3.7 5.6 6.8 7.2M12 8c-1.4 3.1-3.8 5.6-6.8 7.2"/><path d="m14 19 3.5-9 3.5 9M15.3 16h4.4"/></svg>
              <span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s140' | t }}</span>
            </button>
            <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'home' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s124' | t }}</span></a>
            <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'shop' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s236' | t }}</span></a>
            <div class="sp-mobile-menu-label">{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s051' | t }}</div>
            <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?sort_by=best-selling">{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s098' | t }}</a>
            <a href="{{ collections['puja-kit'].url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'package' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s199' | t }}</span></a>
            <a href="{{ all_products['daily-puja-kit'].url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'calendar' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s068' | t }}</span></a>
            <a href="{{ all_products['navratri-puja-kit'].url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'sparkles' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s146' | t }}</span></a>
            <a href="{{ all_products['diwali-puja-kit'].url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'gift' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s080' | t }}</span></a>
            <a href="{{ collections['astrology-remedy-kits'].url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'sparkles' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s020' | t }}</span></a>
            <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}?sort_by=created-descending">{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s151' | t }}</a>
            <a href="{{ collections['puja-items'].url }}">{% render 'sabpuja-icon', name: 'grid' %}<span>{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s197' | t }}</span></a>
            <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s238' | t }}</a>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form class="sp-header-search sp-header-search-mobile" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search">
      <input type="hidden" name="type" value="product">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sp-icon"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
      <input type="search" name="q" value="{{ search.terms | escape }}" placeholder="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s229' | t }}" aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s228' | t }}">
    </form>
  </div>
</header>
<!-- Sabpuja first-visit language chooser -->
<div class="sp-language-modal" id="sp-language-modal" hidden aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="sp-language-modal__backdrop" data-sp-language-close></div>
  <section class="sp-language-modal__dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="sp-language-title" aria-describedby="sp-language-subtitle">
    <button class="sp-language-modal__close" type="button" data-sp-language-close aria-label="{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s050' | t }}">×</button>
    <div class="sp-language-modal__emblem" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h10M9 3v2M6 8c1.4 3.1 3.7 5.6 6.8 7.2M12 8c-1.4 3.1-3.8 5.6-6.8 7.2"/><path d="m14 19 3.5-9 3.5 9M15.3 16h4.4"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h2 id="sp-language-title">{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s281' | t }}</h2>
    <p id="sp-language-subtitle">Choose your language / अपनी भाषा चुनें</p>

    <div class="sp-language-choice-grid">
      {% form 'localization', id: 'sp-modal-language-en' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="locale_code" value="en">
        <button class="sp-language-choice{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %} is-active{% endif %}" type="submit" data-sp-language-choice="en" lang="en">
          <span class="sp-language-choice__glyph">Aa</span>
          <strong>English</strong>
          <small>Read &amp; shop in English</small>
          {% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}<span class="sp-language-choice__status">{{ 'sabpuja_custom.auto.s061' | t }}</span>{% endif %}
        </button>
      {% endform %}

      {% form 'localization', id: 'sp-modal-language-hi' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="locale_code" value="hi">
        <button class="sp-language-choice{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'hi' %} is-active{% endif %}" type="submit" data-sp-language-choice="hi" lang="hi">
          <span class="sp-language-choice__glyph sp-language-choice__glyph--devanagari">अ</span>
          <strong>हिंदी</strong>
          <small>हिंदी में पढ़ें और खरीदें</small>
          {% if request.locale.iso_code == 'hi' %}<span class="sp-language-choice__status">वर्तमान भाषा</span>{% endif %}
        </button>
      {% endform %}
    </div>

    <p class="sp-language-modal__hint">
      You can switch between English and हिंदी any time from the language selector in the navigation bar.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
<!-- /Sabpuja first-visit language chooser -->

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Sabpuja Header",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"logo","label":"Logo image"},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"logo_mobile","label":"Mobile logo image"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"header_sticky","label":"Enable sticky header","default":true}
  ]
}
{% endschema %}